# The image builds from the repo root; everything the build actually needs is
# listed explicitly in apps/workspace/Dockerfile. Keeping the context small is
# most of the difference between a fast build and a slow one — node_modules
# alone is ~800MB.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/cdk.out

.git
.github
.claude
data
docs
experiments
skills
tasks.md
temp.md

# Note: apps/registry, apps/tailor and infra are deliberately NOT ignored —
# the Dockerfile copies their package.json files so the workspace's importer
# set matches the lockfile under --frozen-lockfile. Only their manifests are
# ever read; no source from them enters the image.

**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
